## iRacing SDK semantics (do not guess flags)

GARAGE is the garage **UI**, not car-in-stall physics.

| Flag | Means | After session load (lobby) |
|------|--------|----------------------------|
| `IsGarageVisible` | Garage screen visible | false |
| `IsInGarage` / `PlayerCarInGarage` | Car physics in stall | **true** (false GARAGE) |
| `CamCameraState` bit 0 | Session screen / menu | often set |

Rules:

- `extract_mode()`: GARAGE from `IsGarageVisible`. Stall flags alone are not GARAGE (fallback: stall **and** not session screen).
- After LOADING/CONNECTING, keep **LOBBY and GARAGE** in grace (`GRACE_PERIOD_MS`, 3000). Do **not** skip grace for GARAGE.
- Stable GARAGE for the full grace window still switches (real garage).
- RACE/REPLAY switch after debounce only (no extra post-load delay).
- Do not invent telemetry names; check official iRacing vars.
- Scene switches go through `logic/` only. Log **why** (`decision_inputs`), not just the scene.

Symptom of a regression: first switch after load is garage scene (`Back`) then lobby (`VR`) ~3s later.
